title: "INFO 521: Machine Learning Foundations — Interactive Activities"
abstract: >-
  Six browser-based interactive tools supporting INFO 521, Machine Learning
  Foundations, at the University of Arizona College of Information Science.
  Used for in-class and asynchronous peer-engagement activities across the
  course's modules on estimation, inference, and uncertainty. Static site,
  no build step required. Companion repository to the INFO 521 course hub.
